stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> DRAFT : Order(customer, id)
    DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : confirm()<br/>requiere artículos y cliente activo<br/>⟶ OrderConfirmed
    CONFIRMED --> SHIPPED : ship(guía)<br/>requiere número de guía<br/>⟶ OrderShipped
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancel(motivo)<br/>requiere motivo<br/>⟶ OrderCancelled
    SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : deliver()<br/>⟶ OrderDelivered
    SHIPPED --> RETURNED : return_order()<br/>⟶ OrderReturned
    DELIVERED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    RETURNED --> [*]
    note right of DRAFT
        add_item() solo en DRAFT
        máximo 20 unidades por pedido
    end note
